ror, account identifier, recent changes, device scope and approved recovery options before resetting anything.","exception":null},{"rule_number":2,"title":"Workplace method","explanation":"Begin open, narrow with closed questions, verify the root issue, compare allowed solutions, explain the decision and escalate with complete notes when necessary.","why_it_works":"Example: Use Decision tree, knowledge base and escalation template and retain evidence of the result.","exception":null},{"rule_number":3,"title":"Quality and interview check","explanation":"Verify the outcome, explain trade-offs and avoid: Asking unrelated questions, repeating information already provided or escalating before completing required checks.","why_it_works":"Example: Which open and closed questions would diagnose an intermittent login problem?","exception":null}],"important_distinctions":[]},"application_method":{"method_title":"Learn, configure, validate","method_overview":"Connect the idea to a practical workflow, then validate the outcome.","steps":[{"step_number":1,"title":"Understand","instruction":"Identify the process goal, actors, inputs and expected outcome.","reason":"A clear process prevents incorrect work.","student_check":"Can you explain the goal in one sentence?"},{"step_number":2,"title":"Apply","instruction":"Practise this workflow: Begin open, narrow with closed questions, verify the root issue, compare allowed solutions, explain the decision and escalate with complete notes when necessary.","reason":"Hands-on execution turns knowledge into a reusable skill.","student_check":"Did you complete every required part?"},{"step_number":3,"title":"Validate","instruction":"Test the result, review the evidence and correct any gap.","reason":"Validation makes the work reliable and interview-ready.","student_check":"Does the result satisfy the stated outcome?"}],"use_when":"Use this workflow for apply work.","do_not_use_when":"Do not expose confidential information or skip verification